  "summary": "Advanced drawing features for System.Drawing types. Among others: fast bitmap manipulation, shape/text drawing, quantizing and dithering, saving bitmaps and metafiles in various formats, creating animated GIFs in high color, manipulating high resolution multi-image icons, etc.",
